     "explanation": "SASP is the secretome of senescent cells — pro-inflammatory cytokines (IL-6, IL-8), matrix metalloproteinases, and growth factors that drive 'inflammaging' and spread senescence to neighbors.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' fill='#FFD700' font-size='36' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Quiz: SASP</text><text x='550' y='115' fill='#888' font-size='24' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>What zombie cells secrete</text><rect x='100' y='200' width='900' height='260' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='250' fill='#ef4444' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>SASP Components</text><text x='150' y='310' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Cytokines: IL-6, IL-8, TNF-alpha</text><text x='150' y='350' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Proteases: MMP-1, MMP-3, MMP-9</text><text x='150' y='390' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Growth factors: VEGF, HGF</text><text x='150' y='430' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Chemokines and ROS</text><rect x='100' y='490' width='900' height='220' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='535' fill='#8b5cf6' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Effects</text><text x='150' y='585' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Local inflammation and tissue remodeling</text><text x='150' y='620' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Recruits immune cells (which often fail to clear)</text><text x='150' y='655' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Spreads senescence to bystander cells</text><rect x='100' y='740' width='900' height='200' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='785' fill='#0ea5e9' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Therapeutic Target</text><text x='550' y='830' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Senolytics kill senescent cells</text><text x='550' y='865' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Senomorphics suppress SASP without killing</text></svg>",
      "caption": "SASP is the molecular face of inflammaging."
     }
