     "explanation": "Rapamycin's lifespan extension in mice was first shown by the NIA Interventions Testing Program in 2009 and replicated multiple times. It works even started late, and works in both sexes. Side effects exist (mouth sores, immunosuppression) but pulsed dosing may mitigate them.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' fill='#FFD700' font-size='36' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Quiz: Rapamycin</text><text x='550' y='115' fill='#888' font-size='24' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Why so much promise?</text><rect x='100' y='200' width='900' height='240' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='250' fill='#0ea5e9' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Evidence Stack</text><text x='150' y='305' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>NIA ITP 2009: 9% F, 14% M lifespan gain</text><text x='150' y='350' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Replicated 4+ times in mice</text><text x='150' y='395' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Works started late in life</text><rect x='100' y='460' width='900' height='220' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#FFD700' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='505' fill='#FFD700' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Mechanism Solid</text><text x='150' y='555' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Direct mTOR inhibition</text><text x='150' y='590' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Conserved pathway from yeast to mammals</text><text x='150' y='625' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Autophagy activation is observable</text><rect x='100' y='700' width='900' height='240' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='745' fill='#8b5cf6' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Caution</text><text x='150' y='795' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Side effects: mouth sores, infection, glucose</text><text x='150' y='830' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Pulsed dosing reduces some side effects</text><text x='150' y='865' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Not FDA-approved for aging in humans</text><text x='150' y='900' fill='#888' font-size='18' font-family='Arial'>Off-label use is increasingly common in geroscience clinics.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Best mouse data; human trials in progress."
     }
