    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: Reprogramming or Senolytics?",
     "content": "Imagine you can fund only one approach: partial reprogramming or senolytics. Write a 2-page memo defending your choice. Address evidence base, safety, scalability, equity, and 10-year timeline.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' fill='#FFD700' font-size='36' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Practice 1: One Approach</text><text x='550' y='115' fill='#888' font-size='24' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Choose and defend</text><rect x='100' y='180' width='900' height='240' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='225' fill='#0ea5e9' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>The Choice</text><text x='150' y='275' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Pick A or B:</text><text x='150' y='310' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>A. Partial reprogramming (Sinclair line)</text><text x='150' y='345' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>B. Senolytics (Kirkland line)</text><text x='150' y='380' fill='#888' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>One only — no hedging.</text><rect x='100' y='440' width='900' height='240' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#FFD700' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='485' fill='#FFD700' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Required Sections</text><text x='150' y='535' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>1. Strongest evidence (1 study each)</text><text x='150' y='570' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>2. Safety concern (top risk)</text><text x='150' y='605' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>3. Scalability (cost per patient)</text><text x='150' y='640' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>4. Equity considerations</text><rect x='100' y='700' width='900' height='240' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='745' fill='#8b5cf6' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Bottom-line judgment</text><text x='150' y='795' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>5. 10-year timeline forecast</text><text x='150' y='830' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>6. Which approach reaches patients first?</text><text x='150' y='870' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>7. Your overall bet — defend it.</text><text x='150' y='905' fill='#888' font-size='18' font-family='Arial'>2 page memo, due before Lesson 8.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Forced choice clarifies values and trade-offs."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: Map a Reprogramming Trial",
     "content": "Find a real reprogramming or senolytic clinical trial on ClinicalTrials.gov. Summarize: target condition, intervention, primary outcome, sample size, status. Suggest the next study you'd run if this one succeeds.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' fill='#FFD700' font-size='36' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Practice 2: Trial Map</text><text x='550' y='115' fill='#888' font-size='24' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Real trials, real designs</text><rect x='100' y='180' width='900' height='200' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='225' fill='#0ea5e9' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Step 1: Find a Trial</text><text x='150' y='275' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>ClinicalTrials.gov</text><text x='150' y='310' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Search: \"senolytic\", \"fisetin\", \"rapamycin\",</text><text x='150' y='345' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>\"OSK\", \"Yamanaka\", \"epigenetic age\"</text><rect x='100' y='400' width='900' height='240' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#FFD700' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='445' fill='#FFD700' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Step 2: Summarize</text><text x='150' y='495' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>NCT number, sponsor</text><text x='150' y='530' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Condition + intervention</text><text x='150' y='565' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Phase, primary outcome, n</text><text x='150' y='600' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Estimated completion</text><rect x='100' y='660' width='900' height='280' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='705' fill='#8b5cf6' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Step 3: Next Study</text><text x='150' y='755' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>If this trial succeeds, what is the next logical study?</text><text x='150' y='790' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Phase III? New indication? Different population?</text><text x='150' y='825' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>What would block it?</text><text x='150' y='865' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>What endpoints would the FDA accept?</text><text x='550' y='915' fill='#888' font-size='18' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Deliverable: 1 page trial summary + 1 page next-study proposal</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Real trial design is the field's actual currency."
     }
    }
